  <name>FillAccessValuesSetsForTabularSectionsDocuments</name>
  <synonym>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Populate access value sets of document tables</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>تکمیل مجموعه‌های مقدار دسترسی جدول‌های سند</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Compilare i set di valori di accesso alle parti tabellari</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Wypełnij zestawy wartości dostępu sekcji tabelarycznych dokumentów</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Заполнить наборы значений доступа табличных частей документов</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Belgelerin tablo bölümleri için erişim değerleri setlerini doldur</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Điền tập hợp giá trị truy cập phần bảng chứng từ</value>
  </synonym>
  <comment>The subscription is supplied by the access Control subsystem to populate the table part of the set of access Values for the metadata objects in which it was created for the #set of Values template to work</comment>
  <source>
    <types>DefinedType.OwnerWithRestrictedAccessValueSetsDocument</types>
  </source>
  <event>BeforeWrite</event>
  <handler>CommonModule.AccessManagementInternal.FillAccessValuesSetsForTabularSections</handler>
</mdclass:EventSubscription>
